  "blocks": [
    {
      "uuid": "6db320b8-5e5f-4311-a762-fade2f654861",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": "cap",
      "kind": "heading",
      "content": "CAP 定理",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 0,
      "line_end": 1
    },
    {
      "uuid": "42feeb05-1673-4bbe-b9a4-3816fb48b741",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": "CAP 定理指出，分布式系统最多只能同时满足以下三项中的两项：",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 2,
      "line_end": 3
    },
    {
      "uuid": "513580d0-3099-4e63-8241-87d232244500",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": "consistency-block-consistency",
      "kind": "heading",
      "content": "一致性（Consistency） {#block-consistency}",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 4,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "uuid": "9263e61a-6f2c-4b86-978f-c24f906013c5",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": "所有节点在同一时间看到的数据是一致的。",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 6,
      "line_end": 7
    },
    {
      "uuid": "3ea43f25-4978-461a-a4f9-9babc2e84943",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": "availability-block-availability",
      "kind": "heading",
      "content": "可用性（Availability） {#block-availability}",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 8,
      "line_end": 9
    },
    {
      "uuid": "8f414f92-9b40-474b-b59b-495cfd4257bb",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": "每个请求都能在有限时间内收到非错误的响应。",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 10,
      "line_end": 11
    },
    {
      "uuid": "205d40c6-c06f-46f1-b007-90814289260a",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": "partition-tolerance-block-partition",
      "kind": "heading",
      "content": "分区容错性（Partition Tolerance） {#block-partition}",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 12,
      "line_end": 13
    },
    {
      "uuid": "b83efbc3-d503-4da0-803b-bc0b4d817161",
      "page_path": "CAP 定理.ad",
      "block_id": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": "系统在遇到网络分区时仍能继续运行。",
      "properties": "{}",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 15
    },
    {
